@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Gateway health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Login routed through Gateway -> Eureka -> Auth
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: gateway-login-test

{
  "email": "YOUR_EMAIL@example.com",
  "password": "YOUR_PASSWORD"
}

### Unknown route should not be auto-exposed from Eureka
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth-service/api/v1/auth/login

### Gateway request id: invalid client value is replaced
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
X-Request-Id: this value contains spaces and should be replaced

### Identity-owned current user route (paste a valid access token)
@accessToken = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Identity-owned users route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Identity-owned roles route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
